cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IGLOO: Integration of a General Lagrangian One-way ODE set"
abstract: >-
  IGLOO is an open-source Lagrangian particle solver written in modern Fortran. It integrates each particle's ODE state — position, velocity, temperature, diameter — through a steady background gas field. Drag and heat transfer are always integrated; evaporation, secondary breakup.
type: software
